Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,IN「空の箱」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.91,0:09:14.04,IN_01_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\blur2\3c&HC12FC6&\3a&H00&}地図にはないはずの三叉路に今
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.21,0:09:16.71,IN_01_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\blur2\3c&HC12FC6&\3a&H00&}ぶつかっているのですが
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.71,0:09:23.89,IN_01_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\blur2\3c&HC12FC6&\3a&H00&}何を頼りに進めばいいのでしょうか
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.16,0:09:50.87,IN_01_JP,,0,0,64,,{\fad(180,180)\blur2\an8\3c&HC12FC6&\3a&H00&}ならどうやって先へと進みますか
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.87,0:09:54.13,IN_01_JP,,0,0,64,,{\fad(180,180)\blur2\an8\3c&HC12FC6&\3a&H00&}やけに白いんだ　やたら長いんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.13,0:09:59.30,IN_01_JP,,0,0,64,,{\fad(180,180)\blur2\an8\3c&HC12FC6&\3a&H00&}コタエはだいたいカタチばかりの常識だろう
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.30,0:10:03.84,IN_01_JP,,0,0,64,,{\fad(180,180)\blur2\an8\3c&HC12FC6&\3a&H00&}指先が震えようとも
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.84,0:10:05.55,IN_01_JP,,0,0,64,,{\fad(180,180)\blur2\an8\3c&HC12FC6&\3a&H00&}正解は無いんだ
Dialogue: 1,0:09:09.91,0:09:14.04,IN_01_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\blur2\3c&HC12FC6&\3a&H00&}本不該存在於地圖的三岔路口
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.21,0:09:16.71,IN_01_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\blur2\3c&HC12FC6&\3a&H00&}卻出現在了我的面前
Dialogue: 1,0:09:16.71,0:09:23.89,IN_01_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\blur2\3c&HC12FC6&\3a&H00&}我究竟該跟隨甚麼繼續前進
Dialogue: 1,0:09:46.16,0:09:50.87,IN_01_CH,,0,0,10,,{\fad(180,180)\blur2\an8\3c&HC12FC6&\3a&H00&}如果換你來 你會選擇如何前進
Dialogue: 1,0:09:50.87,0:09:54.13,IN_01_CH,,0,0,10,,{\fad(180,180)\blur2\an8\3c&HC12FC6&\3a&H00&}一片白茫茫 感覺如此漫長
Dialogue: 1,0:09:54.13,0:09:59.30,IN_01_CH,,0,0,10,,{\fad(180,180)\blur2\an8\3c&HC12FC6&\3a&H00&}所謂答案 大多是虛有其表的常識吧
Dialogue: 1,0:09:59.30,0:10:03.84,IN_01_CH,,0,0,10,,{\fad(180,180)\blur2\an8\3c&HC12FC6&\3a&H00&}縱使指尖顫抖
Dialogue: 1,0:10:03.84,0:10:05.55,IN_01_CH,,0,0,10,,{\fad(180,180)\blur2\an8\3c&HC12FC6&\3a&H00&}不存在正解
